  <Texts>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: <color=#FF99DD>Ho ho, yes. Your species has always been
      a curious bunch, weren't you? Always exploring new horizons and experimenting.
      Back then, it took a lot to scare off a human. Especially the most... Libidinous
      ones.
    TextAlignment: 260
  - <Text>k__BackingField: <color=#FF99DD>But I was glad to discover they were more
      than up to the task.
    TextAlignment: 260
  - <Text>k__BackingField: She now shifts on her belly, facing me, taking a more
      comfortable pose and a better look at me, her massive tits dissapearing from
      my view.
    TextAlignment: 257
  - <Text>k__BackingField: <color=#FF99DD>As of now... Before I grant you your reward
      to arriving this far, I assume you must have some questions for me, yes?
    TextAlignment: 260
  <Illustration>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  <Bgm>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  <SFX>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  <Item>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  <Branches>k__BackingField:
  - Text: '- "What happened to your cult?"'
    Next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2556c021282d1cf45a00cf7ba38188fc, type: 2}
  - Text: '- "What is this place?"'
    Next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ed77ef69b09794d458a8f23e5a7d6021, type: 2}
  - Text: '- "How did I end up here?"'
    Next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ff757848546bde744ac65aaf1691eeec, type: 2}
  - Text: '- "You mentioned a ''reward''?"'
    Next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1b974c4d9270ee440b4c5f6df71809ba, type: 2}
  - Text: '- "I have no more questions."'
    Next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 310c89589aaf2b247af5a8ee27aff595, type: 2}
